:: Carter House Pee Pool [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 3>>
You are enjoying your time with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> when you suddenly get that familiar feeling in your groin. No, not that feeling, but rather the one that tells you it is time to use the restroom. While peeing in the pool would be an option, that would also be incredibly rude and disrespectful to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> and his family, so you tell <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> you need to use the facilities. <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Carter",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Swim",
                Mouth: "Frown",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“The what?”</span> He responds in confusion to your wording. You explain yourself clearer and he laughs. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh! Sure thing, just dry off a bit before you head inside. It’s fine if you drip a little on the carpet, just don’t get water on anything else.”</span> He pauses, before suddenly adding, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Especially the couch! If you do that, we’re as good as dead!”</span> <br>
<br>
You promise to be careful and head inside, quickly scurrying to the bathroom and doing your business. Once done, you wash your hands and return to the backyard, <span style="color:LightGreen">successful in going without making a mess.</span> <br>
<<needChange "Bladder" 100>>
<br>
[[Continue|Carter House Backyard Swim]]